<title>USA: Santa Anita gets offers from other buyers.</title>
<headline>Santa Anita gets offers from other buyers.</headline>
<dateline>ARCADIA, Calif. 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santa Anita Cos said on Thursday it has received confidential proposals from several buyers in addition to the previously announced offer by Koll Arcadia Investors and Colony Capital Inc.</p>
<p>Koll and Colony offered to recapitalize Santa Anita with $116.5 million.</p>
<p>Santa Anita said its special committees of independent directors, advised by Morgan Stanley Group Inc, have begun a final round of negotiations with selected potential buyers.</p>
<p>Koll Arcadia is a partnership composed of principals of Koll Cos and Apollo Real Estate Investors.</p>
<p>Santa Anita, a real estate investment trust, closed on Thursday at 28, down 1/8.</p>
